{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Offense meets Virtual Reality</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/ec026f04e4cb834f16686fbb6021e975.poster.avif?t=1747372284\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/ec026f04e4cb834f16686fbb6021e975.webm?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/ec026f04e4cb834f16686fbb6021e975.mp4?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Toy Clash is a tower offense game to beat up your enemy\u2019s tower while protect yourself safe from their attacks. You are required to dominate the battlefield using your own strategy by leading your toy units and using powerful magics. At the end of the game, you will become a god of battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><strong>Strategic Play</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/58825d9727b5d46945ab53f56d431555.poster.avif?t=1747372284\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/58825d9727b5d46945ab53f56d431555.webm?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/58825d9727b5d46945ab53f56d431555.mp4?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every toy unit in Toy Clash is either stronger or weaker to a particular type of unit. So you will need to put a tanker type unit in front of long ranged units to defend their weak health points vulnerable to a melee attack. This means it is very important for player to know when and where to place units by seeing how battle is going. And the way the units are deployed will very much likely to determine your victory or defeat.<br><br><strong>Adorable Toys</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/dac3ce096e98a61b706b5b0bf34b8516.poster.avif?t=1747372284\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/dac3ce096e98a61b706b5b0bf34b8516.webm?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/dac3ce096e98a61b706b5b0bf34b8516.mp4?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>All toys in Toy Clash are made in a neat and stylish graphics which makes it pleasurable to watch them. They are also very faithful to your command, so show them your omnipotence.<br><br><strong>Extremely refined level design</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/7b6c2c3d8004cdcf4dc5c5214c4e3c72.poster.avif?t=1747372284\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/7b6c2c3d8004cdcf4dc5c5214c4e3c72.webm?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/7b6c2c3d8004cdcf4dc5c5214c4e3c72.mp4?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Toy Clash offers an immersive experience that you cannot put your headset down. Enjoy the thrill of winning victory from enemy\u2019s aggression.<br><br><strong>Growth of toys</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/26ad4cb4f6f9de5bd73641efa753e967.poster.avif?t=1747372284\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/26ad4cb4f6f9de5bd73641efa753e967.webm?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/extras/26ad4cb4f6f9de5bd73641efa753e967.mp4?t=1747372284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The more you win, the better your play skills and the stronger your toy units become. Use these to punish the bad toys that are against you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Toy clash comes with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>48 stages - Includes 9 challenge stages and 3 boss stages.<br></li><li>World consisting of three stage themes<br></li><li>23 different toy units<br></li><li>6 powerful spells - use them to show off your power</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/620360?t=1747372284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/620360?t=1747372284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747372284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747372284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>News</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free DLC will be released in mid-November this year</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>We will include some bonus stages, at the cost of free.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Offense meets Virtual Reality</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 